{"timestamp":"2026-08-13T02:32:35.236Z","ordinal":11887,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ff6a5-15b4-7543-9152-181e73d10fba","turn_id":"019ff8e3-035b-72e3-a1a3-100f88997619","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-6e9f8e1e-af5f-40c2-bfe4-32d365b4ca96","process_id":"44311","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","lobu call -c prod --org buremba --list --all --json | jq '.tools[] | select(.name==\"manage_operations\") | {description,inputSchema}'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/burakemre/Code/lobu","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"lobu call -c prod --org buremba --list --all --json | jq '.tools[] | select(.name==\"manage_operations\") | {description,inputSchema}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"{\n  \"description\": \"Operation execution / approval. SDK alternative: client.operations.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"action\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"enum\": [\n          \"list_available\",\n          \"execute\",\n          \"list_runs\",\n          \"get_run\",\n          \"list_activity\",\n          \"approve\",\n          \"reject\",\n          \"approve_batch\",\n          \"reject_batch\"\n        ],\n        \"description\": \"Action to perform.\\n- list_available: Discover connector operations (capabilities) across bundled, custom, and device connectors, with per-operation connection readiness. Returns a PUBLIC DTO (no backend_config). Capabilities stay discoverable even with no connection; use the readiness + next_action fields to drive discover → connect/setup → poll → execute.\\n- execute: Execute an operation; may queue for approval / device / inline. Required: connection_id, operation_key.\\n- list_runs: Paginated operational run list with keyset cursor support. Chat-message transport runs (complete replies + streaming deltas, run_type='chat_message') are excluded unless explicitly requested via run_types.\\n- get_run: Fetch one connector action or internal approval run. Required: run_id.\\n- list_activity: Org attention feed: notifications + recent user-facing runs (Behavior/sync/action/internal), with optional adjacent aggregation and deep-links for the UI and agent context.\\n- approve: Approve a pending run (also handles agent + entity_field_change gates). Required: run_id.\\n- reject: Reject a pending run. Required: run_id.\\n- approve_batch: Approve many pending approvals at once. Either scope by window_id (a Behavior run's proposals) or by `scope` (queued connector operations). Exactly one of the two is required — there is no unscoped approve-everything.\\n- reject_batch: Reject many pending approvals at once. Either scope by window_id (a Behavior run's proposals — the reason is fed back so the agent revises) or by `scope` (queued connector operations). Exactly one of the two is required.\"\n      },\n      \"connector_key\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by connector key\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"connection_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by connection ID\",\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"entity_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by entity ID\",\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"kind\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by operation kind (read/write)\",\n        \"anyOf\": [\n          {\n            \"const\": \"read\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"const\": \"write\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"backend\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by operation backend type\",\n        \"anyOf\": [\n          {\n            \"const\": \"local_action\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"const\": \"mcp_tool\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"const\": \"http_operation\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"query\": {\n        \"description\": \"Data-driven search over connector name/key, operation name/key, description, and input-schema property names/terms. A query like 'github create issue' returns matching capabilities across every installed connector (including ones with no connection yet).\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"include_disconnected\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"description\": \"Include capabilities whose connector has NO ready connection (default true). Set false to list only executable operations.\",\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"include_input_schema\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"description\": \"Include input schema in response\",\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"include_output_schema\": {\n        \"default\": false,\n        \"description\": \"Include output schema in response\",\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"limit\": {\n        \"description\": \"Page size (default: 100)\",\n        \"default\": 100,\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"offset\": {\n        \"description\": \"Pagination offset (default: 0)\",\n        \"default\": 0,\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"operation_key\": {\n        \"description\": \"Connector-local operation key\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"input\": {\n        \"description\": \"Operation input\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"patternProperties\": {\n          \"^(.*)$\": {}\n        }\n      },\n      \"idempotency_key\": {\n        \"minLength\": 1,\n        \"maxLength\": 256,\n        \"description\": \"Durable caller key. Replays return the original operation run; reusing the key for a different operation or input is rejected.\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"behavior_source\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\n          \"behavior_id\",\n          \"window_id\"\n        ],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"behavior_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"window_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"connection_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"description\": \"Filter by connection IDs\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"feed_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"description\": \"Filter by feed IDs\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"device_worker_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by device worker ID\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"status\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by run status\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"approval_status\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by approval status\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"run_types\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"description\": \"Filter by run types\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"created_after\": {\n        \"description\": \"Only runs created at or after this ISO 8601 timestamp (inclusive)\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"created_before\": {\n        \"description\": \"Only runs created before this ISO 8601 timestamp (exclusive)\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"behavior_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"description\": \"Filter by persisted Behavior IDs\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"before_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Keyset cursor: return runs before this ID\",\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"before_created_at\": {\n        \"description\": \"Keyset cursor: return runs before this timestamp\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"run_id\": {\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"include_notifications\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"include_runs\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"aggregate\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"kinds\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"agent_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Scope activity to a single agent's runs\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"reason\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"window_id\": {\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"scope\": {\n        \"description\": \"Scope filters for a connector-approval batch. At least one of connection_id / connector_key / action_key / behavior_id is required.\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"connection_id\": {\n            \"minimum\": 1,\n            \"description\": \"Only approvals queued against this connection.\",\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          },\n          \"connector_key\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"description\": \"Only approvals for this connector (e.g. 'github').\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"action_key\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"description\": \"Only approvals for this operation key.\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"behavior_id\": {\n            \"minimum\": 1,\n            \"description\": \"Only approvals queued by this Behavior.\",\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          },\n          \"older_than_days\": {\n            \"minimum\": 1,\n            \"description\": \"Only approvals queued more than this many days ago. Narrows further; never widens.\",\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"run_ids\": {\n        \"minItems\": 1,\n        \"maxItems\": 5000,\n        \"uniqueItems\": true,\n        \"description\": \"Exact proposal run IDs shown to the reviewer. The batch fails closed if the pending set changed.\",\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"integer\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"action\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"description\": \"Operation execution / approval. SDK alternative: client.operations.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"action\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"enum\": [\n          \"list_available\",\n          \"execute\",\n          \"list_runs\",\n          \"get_run\",\n          \"list_activity\",\n          \"approve\",\n          \"reject\",\n          \"approve_batch\",\n          \"reject_batch\"\n        ],\n        \"description\": \"Action to perform.\\n- list_available: Discover connector operations (capabilities) across bundled, custom, and device connectors, with per-operation connection readiness. Returns a PUBLIC DTO (no backend_config). Capabilities stay discoverable even with no connection; use the readiness + next_action fields to drive discover → connect/setup → poll → execute.\\n- execute: Execute an operation; may queue for approval / device / inline. Required: connection_id, operation_key.\\n- list_runs: Paginated operational run list with keyset cursor support. Chat-message transport runs (complete replies + streaming deltas, run_type='chat_message') are excluded unless explicitly requested via run_types.\\n- get_run: Fetch one connector action or internal approval run. Required: run_id.\\n- list_activity: Org attention feed: notifications + recent user-facing runs (Behavior/sync/action/internal), with optional adjacent aggregation and deep-links for the UI and agent context.\\n- approve: Approve a pending run (also handles agent + entity_field_change gates). Required: run_id.\\n- reject: Reject a pending run. Required: run_id.\\n- approve_batch: Approve many pending approvals at once. Either scope by window_id (a Behavior run's proposals) or by `scope` (queued connector operations). Exactly one of the two is required — there is no unscoped approve-everything.\\n- reject_batch: Reject many pending approvals at once. Either scope by window_id (a Behavior run's proposals — the reason is fed back so the agent revises) or by `scope` (queued connector operations). Exactly one of the two is required.\"\n      },\n      \"connector_key\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by connector key\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"connection_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by connection ID\",\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"entity_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by entity ID\",\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"kind\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by operation kind (read/write)\",\n        \"anyOf\": [\n          {\n            \"const\": \"read\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"const\": \"write\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"backend\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by operation backend type\",\n        \"anyOf\": [\n          {\n            \"const\": \"local_action\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"const\": \"mcp_tool\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"const\": \"http_operation\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"query\": {\n        \"description\": \"Data-driven search over connector name/key, operation name/key, description, and input-schema property names/terms. A query like 'github create issue' returns matching capabilities across every installed connector (including ones with no connection yet).\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"include_disconnected\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"description\": \"Include capabilities whose connector has NO ready connection (default true). Set false to list only executable operations.\",\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"include_input_schema\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"description\": \"Include input schema in response\",\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"include_output_schema\": {\n        \"default\": false,\n        \"description\": \"Include output schema in response\",\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"limit\": {\n        \"description\": \"Page size (default: 100)\",\n        \"default\": 100,\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"offset\": {\n        \"description\": \"Pagination offset (default: 0)\",\n        \"default\": 0,\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"operation_key\": {\n        \"description\": \"Connector-local operation key\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"input\": {\n        \"description\": \"Operation input\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"patternProperties\": {\n          \"^(.*)$\": {}\n        }\n      },\n      \"idempotency_key\": {\n        \"minLength\": 1,\n        \"maxLength\": 256,\n        \"description\": \"Durable caller key. Replays return the original operation run; reusing the key for a different operation or input is rejected.\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"behavior_source\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\n          \"behavior_id\",\n          \"window_id\"\n        ],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"behavior_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"window_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"connection_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"description\": \"Filter by connection IDs\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"feed_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"description\": \"Filter by feed IDs\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"device_worker_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by device worker ID\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"status\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by run status\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"approval_status\": {\n        \"description\": \"Filter by approval status\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"run_types\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"description\": \"Filter by run types\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"created_after\": {\n        \"description\": \"Only runs created at or after this ISO 8601 timestamp (inclusive)\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"created_before\": {\n        \"description\": \"Only runs created before this ISO 8601 timestamp (exclusive)\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"behavior_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"description\": \"Filter by persisted Behavior IDs\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"before_id\": {\n        \"description\": \"Keyset cursor: return runs before this ID\",\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"before_created_at\": {\n        \"description\": \"Keyset cursor: return runs before this timestamp\",\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"run_id\": {\n        \"type\": \"number\"\n      },\n      \"include_notifications\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"include_runs\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"aggregate\": {\n        \"default\": true,\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      },\n      \"kinds\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"type\": \